{"overview":"کیسکه نییجیما از زمان مرگ همسرش تاکائه، که ده سال پیش درگذشت، در غم غرق بوده است؛ اما وقتی دختری جوان می‌آید و ادعا می‌کند تجسد تاکائه است، کیسکه و دخترش مای به یک دیدار معجزه‌آسا کشیده می‌شوند. همان‌طور که دختر جزئیات صمیمی‌ای را فاش می‌کند که فقط آن‌ها می‌دانستند، خانواده نییجیما به تدریج شفا می‌یابد و عشق و گرما را به‌طرز غیرمنتظره‌ای دوباره می‌یابد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Keisuke Niijima has lived in grief since his wife, Takae, passed away 10 years ago. But when a young girl visits, claiming to be Takae reincarnated, Keisuke and his daughter, Mai, are drawn into a miraculous reunion. As the girl reveals intimate details only they could know, the Niijima family slowly begins to heal, rediscovering love and warmth in the most unexpected way.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2024,"poster":"/yTWwOUTk14JM7LmOzmEFKwNwKf8.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"平川大輔","role":"Keisuke Niijima (voice)","photo":"/8uDi5NxFdxFvfVyo4n5CeOSLWEf.jpg","en":"Daisuke Hirakawa"},{"name":"悠木碧","role":"Takae Niijima (voice) / Marika Shiraishi (voice)","photo":"/a5Mkd66GV1l3c9bZZtnvjUf33T2.jpg","en":"Aoi Yuki"},{"name":"野村麻衣子","role":"Mai Niijima (voice)","photo":"/rTA6YNVccrVv23AHTcukwAiKyvr.jpg","en":"Maiko Nomura"},{"name":"小島幸子","role":"Chika Shiraishi (voice)","photo":"/1WsHUDLy7Jvi5I1VY6uAT4ARnpM.jpg","en":"Sachiko Kojima"},{"name":"岩中睦樹","role":"Renji Aikawa (voice)","photo":"/sf6pNjXI8uMUatZ5EhlZPWt8Xh5.jpg","en":"Mutsuki Iwanaka"}],"trailer":"kIudl9WJAiU","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/257603/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/257603/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":